  "item_short_desc": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Guardian Composite Toe Tactical Boot is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability on the field. The heavy-duty YKK side zipper allows for an easy and quick on/off. The 8 inch height provides additional ankle support and protection. Just like our other Frontline boots, The Guardian is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, The Guardian features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133399",
  "description": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Guardian Composite Toe Tactical Boot is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability on the field. The heavy-duty YKK side zipper allows for an easy and quick on/off. The 8 inch height provides additional ankle support and protection during patrols and tactical operations. Just like our other Frontline boots, The Guardian is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, The Guardian features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction. H2O Lock Weather Protection System: Featuring a premium&nbsp;waterproof leather and polyester upper, these side zip tactical boots ensure your feet stay dry, no matter the environment. The comp toe boot utilizes a waterproof internal lining for added protection, with a moisture wicking mesh liner underneath for breathability while keeping water out. The gusseted tongue helps shield your foot from dirt and debris. Comfort Lock Fatigue Defense System: The molded EVA footbed and EVA midsole help absorb shock, cushioning your feet from impact while providing all-day comfort. These composite toe boots feature a lightweight flexible bonded construction and a nylon shank for added support and stability. Ground Lock Terrain Endurance System: These combat boots are built with a composite toe for impact resistance and additional protection. The tactical work boots come equipped with a high grip lug rubber outsole that is non-slip and oil-resistant, allowing you to maintain your footing with enhanced grip and traction. The non-marking outsole prevents leaving scuff marks on flooring. Efficient Side Zip Design: Engineered to keep you on your feet and moving, the Guardian Composite Toe Tactical Boot offers unbeatable comfort and durability on the field. The heavy-duty YKK side zipper allows for an easy and quick on/off. The 8 inch height provides additional ankle support and protection. Ready at a Moment&rsquo;s Notice: From emergency situations to scheduled patrols, these lightweight tactical boots easily rise above the challenge. These ruggedly durable boots are great for first responders, EMTs, security guards, public safety, active-duty personnel, tactical enthusiasts, and more. On The Frontlines: Utilizing the Lock System, each boot within Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Footwear Series is designed to tackle any job, all day, every day. From field operations to public safety, The Guardian is always ready to protect and serve.</p>",
